{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2015-10", "window": 4, "start_date": 1445644800, "end_date": 1446335999, "month_true_total": 131, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:10:42 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "18803955", "author": {"steamid": "76561198141389633", "personaname": "Mush", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198141389633/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 530, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 390, "last_played": 1456626120, "avatar": "ef4c16ca3829c900c4b2fa8414fd067748852dab"}, "language": "english", "review": "At first the game didn’t appeal to me until I started to play with a few friends of mine. You start out with one character that’s sensibly weak since all the mobs are weak as well, but then unlock more as you continue to play. What makes the game interesting is the power-ups and the artifacts. Very fun game, especially with friends.", "timestamp_created": 1446334210, "timestamp_updated": 1446334210, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18802509", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992838198", "personaname": "Haseroth", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/imnotlegend/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2890, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1426, "last_played": 1753922198, "avatar": "5d2541364dbdc0bc1b2d8311b2d2c02780b5252b"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's pretty good, you won't lie though... you're gonna die... a LOT... and it's not fair....at ALL! but it's fun!especially when you get the hang of it and get to beat the whole game and you get a run of hours on end!", "timestamp_created": 1446328801, "timestamp_updated": 1446328801, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18802256", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996223521", "personaname": "Tazersquad55", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tazersquad55/", "num_games_owned": 1356, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 3099, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1883, "last_played": 1541496806, "avatar": "049116dc3827584518d1124b90aa06b7fab8d023"}, "language": "english", "review": "The game boasts a good selection of characters/classes that all actually play VERY differently. The graphics are well prepared pixel art with a distinctive art style. The game flows very well and the \"time increases difficulty\" system adds some serious pressure into your game. There's certainly enough challenge here to appease most gamers, but casual may want to shy away due to the permanent death system. The online real downside to the game is the lack of its own servers, but thats easily fixed by finding a nice RoR server list through your browser. The items you pick up add enough gruff to make them deliciously desireable so you hunt these ferverently. Overall it makes for a fluid challenge and a good way to spend a few hours and runs!", "timestamp_created": 1446327978, "timestamp_updated": 1446327978, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "1878892